mmits{/sha}","git_commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/git/commits{/sha}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/comments{/number}","issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/deployments","created_at":"2015-06-30T12:16:50Z","updated_at":"2026-10-12T18:02:15Z","pushed_at":"2026-09-28T15:37:21Z","git_url":"git://github.com/graphql/graphql-js.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:graphql/graphql-js.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/graphql/graphql-js.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/graphql/graphql-js","homepage":"http://graphql.org/graphql-js/","size":34493,"stargazers_count":20338,"watchers_count":20338,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":false,"has_wiki":true,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":2115,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":105,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["graphql","graphql-js"],"visibility":"public","forks":2115,"open_issues":105,"watchers":20338,"default_branch":"17.x.x","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"Re-posting here as advised in https://github.com/apollographql/apollo-server/issues/7688. Without digging into source code I'm not exactly sure which part of graphql-js is causing this.\r\n\r\n### Issue Description\r\n\r\nWe've identified a potential resource exhaustion vector which has a significant impact on our CPU and response times. We're currently experiencing this on AS 3 however we're able to reproduce on AS 4.\r\n\r\nWe have a [custom query complexity calc plugin](https://github.com/tadhglewis/apollo-koa-minimal/blob/main/index.mjs#L33) which is intended to handle this scenario and others however it seems before we get to `didResolveOperation` event/stage, there is some processing that takes a long time.\r\n\r\nI'm assuming this is an underlying dependancy in Apollo however I'm not 100% sure so any ideas or suggestions on how we can mitigate this would be great.\r\n\r\n### Link to Reproduction\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/tadhglewis/apollo-koa-minimal\r\n\r\n### Reproduction Steps\r\n\r\n1. `pnpm install && pnpm start`\r\n2. Run\r\n```zsh\r\ncurl \\\r\n--data \"{\\\"query\\\":\\\"{ $(python3 -c \"print('%s' % ('__typename ' * 1000))\")}\\\"}\" \\\r\n--header 'Content-Type: application/json' \\\r\n--include \\\r\n--request POST \\\r\nhttps://example.com/graphql\r\n```\r\nThis will take ~2.5s and increase to ~21s if you change the number of `__typename` to `3000`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"839\" alt=\"Screenshot 2023-08-16 at 10 33 30 pm\" src=\"https://github.com/apollographql/apollo-server/assets/53756558/3227af55-1a90-4374-bac0-4daf6e28bc55\">\r\n\r\n\r\nNotes\r\n- On subsequent requests there seems to be some caching and response time goes to ~10ms however if you change the number of `__typename` by one it will bypass this \r\n- This isn't limited to `__typename`, it can also be hit when using `hello` and I imagine introspection as well","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/3955/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/3955/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"AaronMoat","id":2937187,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MzcxODc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2937187?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat","html_url":"https://github.com/AaronMoat","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AaronMoat/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2023-08-24T11:52:22Z","updated_at":"2023-08-24T11:52:22Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/3958","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/graphql/graphql-js/issues/3958/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/